#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Black Needle was born from a simple "
"idea: tattoos should mean something.</strong></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Black Needle ເກີດຂຶ້ນຈາກແນວຄິດງ່າຍໆ: ຮອຍສັ"
"ກຄວນມີຄວາມໝາຍບາງຢ່າງ.</strong></span>"

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">At <strong>Black Needle</strong>, we turn "
"ideas into ink. From bold statements to subtle details, every tattoo is "
"designed with intention and crafted to become part of your story.<br/><br/></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">ທີ່ <strong>Black Needle</strong>, ພວກເຮົາປ່ຽນຄວ"
"າມຄິດໃຫ້ເປັນນ້ຳມຶກ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ລວດລາຍທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນ ຈົນເຖິງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ອ່ອນຊ້ອຍ, ທຸກໆຮອຍສັກຖືກອອກແບບດ້ວຍຄວາ"
"ມຕັ້ງໃຈ ແລະ ສ້າງສັນຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເລື່ອງລາວຂອງທ່ານ.<br/><br/></span>"

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Our artists combine creativity, precision, "
"and years of craft to create tattoos that feel uniquely yours. From the "
"first sketch to the final needle, we take the time to understand @your "
"vision and bring it to life.<br/><br/></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">ຊ່າງສັກຂອງພວກເຮົາປະສົມປະສານຄວາມຄິດສ້າງສັນ, ຄວາມຊັດເຈ"
"ນ, ແລະ ຝີມືທີ່ສະສົມມາຫຼາຍປີ ເພື່ອສ້າງສັນຮອຍສັກທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກສະເພາະຂອງທ່ານ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຮູບແຕ້ມທຳອິດຈົນເຖິງປ"
"າຍເຂັມສຸດທ້າຍ, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ເວລາເພື່ອເຂົ້າໃຈວິໄສທັດຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນມີຊີວິດຊີວາຂຶ້ນມາ.<br/><br/>"
"</span>"

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">We believe every piece carries a story — a "
"memory, a feeling, a statement, or simply a moment you want to make "
"permanent.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອວ່າຜົນງານທຸກໆອັນມີເລື່ອງລາວ — ຄວາມຊົງຈຳ, ຄວ"
"າມຮູ້ສຶກ, ການສະແດງອອກ, ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົງຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດໄປ.</span>"

