#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:tattoo_shop.appointment_type_1
msgid ""
"Ready to bring your tattoo vision to life? Secure your spot with one of our "
"talented artists by booking an appointment today. Whether you're getting "
"your first tattoo or adding to your collection, our team is here to guide "
"you through the process."
msgstr ""
"ພ້ອມແລ້ວບໍທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອຍສັກໃນຈິນຕະນາການຂອງທ່ານມີຊີວິດຊີວາຂຶ້ນມາ? ຈອງຄິວຂອງທ່ານກັບໜຶ່ງໃນຊ່າງສັກທີ່ມີພອນ"
"ສະຫວັນຂອງພວກເຮົາ ໂດຍການນັດໝາຍມື້ນີ້. ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການສັກຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມລາຍໃໝ່ໃສ່ຄໍເລັກຊັນຂອງທ່ານ, ທີ"
"ມງານຂອງພວກເຮົາພ້ອມແລ້ວທີ່ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຕະຫຼອດທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. module: tattoo_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tattoo_shop.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Ready to get <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_strikethrough\" "
"style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-2); --text-highlight-width: "
"2px;\">inked</span> ?"
msgstr ""
"ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະ<span class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_strikethrough\" "
"style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-2); --text-highlight-width: "
